        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Sulphite pulp, bleached, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Sulphite pulp, bleached, at plant
na;
UUID: 68dda68c-b0c9-3d4d-9e54-a20758f3b43e
This module includes the production of bleached sulphite pulp - including transports to the pulp mill, wood handling, chemical pulping and bleaching, drying process, energy production on-site, recovery cycles of chemicals and internal waste water treatment.; Geography: Data from a small European producer and from the finnish database used as European average data.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Mix of modern Ca-bisulphite and Mg-sulphite bleaching technology.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: Total European market sulphite pulp production in 2000: 1101 kt
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_68dda68c-b0c9-3d4d-9e54-a20758f3b43e.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
